{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f853904e-645a-89e0-a653-03c333bebcdd",
  "created_at": "2026-02-17T13:12:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Tran",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:06:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi. Tariq Tran. I'm on speakerphone, sorry. I'm at home and I'm on a break in a long meeting, so I've only got a few minutes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. I can hear you okay. What's going on with your account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:07-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got a water and sewer bill. It's huge. A pipe broke in the house in January. I want to know about a leak adjustment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So a pipe broke and the usage spiked. Was the pipe inside the house, before the meter or after it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:29-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the meter. In the basement wall. It ran for a few days before we saw it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And has it been repaired?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Plumber fixed it the day we found it. I have the invoice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:07:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that matters. Can I have the name on the account, and the account number if you have a bill in front of you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Here's the thing. The account isn't in my name. It's in my wife's name. Late wife. Her name's still on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry. Thank you for telling me. What's the name on the account?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Linh Tran. L-I-N-H. Tran."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:21-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Linh Tran. And the account number is on the top right of the bill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hold on. [pause] Okay. It's 4471 dash 209."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:34-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me pull that up. [pause] Yes, I have it. The last reading is much higher than the usual quarter. That fits what you describe."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:46-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's about four times what we normally pay. I'm not paying that for water that went into my basement wall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. There is a process to request a review for a leak. It generally needs the repair invoice and a short written request, and someone in the office looks at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Who looks at it? And how long?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The billing supervisor reviews those. I can't tell you the timing for certain, but it usually isn't instant. I'd rather not give you a wrong number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. Does it matter that the account's in her name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:33-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It may. Since the account holder is deceased, they'll likely want to update the account to your name. I'm not sure what documents they'll need. I'll check with the supervisor on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I figured that. Nobody ever told me to change it. Nobody asked."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's common, honestly. It's not something you did wrong. I'll note on the account that you're the surviving spouse and living at the property."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I send the invoice by email?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:10-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd rather you bring it in or mail it to City Hall, attention utilities billing, so it gets attached to the account. I'll ask the supervisor if email is acceptable too, and tell you when I call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. So I want a call back with an answer. Not a letter. A call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put a callback request in. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:41-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0167."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:42-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0167. Is there a good time? You mentioned meetings."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoons are bad. Mornings are better. Before noon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mornings, before noon. I'll note it. And if I miss you, can I leave a voicemail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Voicemail is fine. Just say what you need from me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Also, with a review pending, I'll flag the account so the balance doesn't go to a late notice while it's being looked at. I'll put that in the note too, and I'll confirm with the supervisor."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:11:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. That's one thing I didn't want. A late notice on top of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:11:30-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Just to read back: Linh Tran account, leak after the meter, repaired in January, you're the surviving spouse, you'd like a call back in the morning at 401-555-0167, and you'll send the plumber's invoice."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:11:47-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Plumber's invoice, and the dates. I'll put the dates on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:11:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. The date the leak was found and the date it was fixed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Found it on the ninth. Fixed same day. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:12:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Anything else I can help with while I have you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:12:13-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. My meeting's back on in a minute. Just call me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:12:19-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Someone will be in touch, and I'll try to make it before the end of the week. Thanks for calling, Mr. Tran."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-17T13:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
